# 1. Project Objectives

The main objectives of this project are:

* Automate the software delivery lifecycle.
* Implement CI/CD using Jenkins.
* Build a Java application using Maven.
* Perform automated unit testing.
* Perform source/filesystem security scanning.
* Perform static code analysis using SonarQube.
* Enforce a SonarQube quality gate.
* Store Maven build artifacts in Nexus.
* Containerize the application using Docker.
* Scan Docker images using Trivy.
* Push Docker images to Docker Hub.
* Deploy the application automatically to Kubernetes.
* Use a multi-node Kubernetes cluster.
* Implement Kubernetes RBAC.
* Deploy an NGINX Ingress Controller.
* Verify application deployment automatically.
* Send pipeline completion notifications through email.

