# 38. Troubleshooting Encountered During Implementation

During implementation, several infrastructure and CI/CD issues were encountered and resolved.

## 38.1 Kubernetes API Server / etcd Connection Error

Symptom:

```text
dial tcp 127.0.0.1:2379:
connect: connection refused
```

Cause:

The Kubernetes API server could not communicate with the local etcd instance.

Resolution:

The cluster was reset and rebuilt cleanly using:

```bash
kubeadm reset -f
```

The Kubernetes configuration and CNI configuration were cleaned and the control plane was initialized again.

---

## 38.2 Kubernetes Nodes Not Ready

Symptoms included:

```text
NotReady
```

and:

```text
node.kubernetes.io/not-ready
```

Resolution:

Checked:

```bash
kubectl get nodes
kubectl get pods -n kube-system
sudo systemctl status kubelet
sudo systemctl status containerd
```

The cluster networking and node configuration were corrected.

---

## 38.3 kube-proxy / CNI Problems

System pods were inspected using:

```bash
kubectl get pods -n kube-system -o wide
```

and:

```bash
sudo crictl logs <CONTAINER_ID>
```

The cluster was eventually rebuilt cleanly with:

```text
containerd
Calico
kubeadm
```

