# 49. Resume Project Description

### CI/CD Pipeline for Containerized Java Application

**Technologies:** AWS EC2, Jenkins, Kubernetes, Docker, Maven, Nexus, SonarQube, Trivy, GitHub, Calico, NGINX Ingress, RBAC

* Built an automated CI/CD pipeline using Jenkins to compile, test, scan, package, containerize, and deploy a Java Spring Boot application.
* Provisioned and configured a 3-node Kubernetes cluster on AWS EC2 using kubeadm, containerd, and Calico networking.
* Integrated SonarQube quality gates and Trivy filesystem/container image scanning into the CI/CD workflow.
* Published Maven artifacts to Nexus Repository and Docker images to Docker Hub.
